where id = 3;

Focus: Database setup and schema modifications.

Overview: Demonstrates table creation (t1), column modifications (ALTER TABLE), constraint management (adding and dropping primary keys), and standard CRUD operations (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, DROP) within the satvik database schema.
